sequenceDiagram
    participant Sched as Scheduler
    participant Cache as Redis Queue
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Email as Email Provider
    participant FE as Dashboard (Web App)
    actor U as You
    participant DB as Database (Postgres)
    participant C as Claude Sonnet 5

    Sched->>Cache: Enqueue check-in reminder job
    Cache->>API: Dequeue reminder job
    API->>DB: Load this week's plan items
    DB-->>API: Planned items + statuses
    API->>DB: Mark check-in as pending
    API->>Email: Send reminder
    API->>DB: Log notification (CHECK_IN_REMINDER)
    Email->>U: "Your weekly check-in is ready"

    Note over U,FE: Some time later — next login

    U->>FE: Log in
    FE->>API: Check for pending check-in
    API-->>FE: Check-in pending: true

    FE->>U: Force digest screen (blocks home)
    API-->>FE: This week's plan items
    FE->>U: "How'd this week go?" (per item)
    U->>FE: Mark items done / missed

    FE->>API: Submit check-in
    API->>DB: Record what happened per item
    API->>DB: Check history depth for this user
    DB-->>API: Weeks of feedback collected

    alt Fewer than 2-4 weeks of data
        API-->>FE: Progress popup (week N of 2-4) + generic tips
        FE->>U: "Still learning your patterns — generic tip for now: ..."
    else 2-4+ weeks of data
        alt Items were missed
            API->>DB: Read history for missed categories
            DB-->>API: Past patterns
            API->>C: Ask for suggestions on missed items

            alt Claude call succeeds
                C-->>API: Suggested adjustments
                API->>DB: Save recommendations
                API-->>FE: Show personalized suggestions
                FE->>U: "Move gym to mornings next week?"
            else Claude call fails or times out
                API-->>FE: Show acknowledgment only, suggestion unavailable
            end
        else Everything happened
            API-->>FE: Show acknowledgment in digest screen
        end
    end

    U->>FE: Dismiss / continue
    FE->>API: Mark check-in as resolved
    API->>DB: Clear pending flag
    FE->>U: Proceed to home screen
